    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_09",
      "hash64": "409CB96F657A6DA8",
      "text": "Clove a également apporté un soutien\\nnon négligeable.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_10",
      "hash64": "40994C6F65777E9A",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, il a dit que lui et toi étiez de bons\\namis... Vous vous connaissez depuis longtemps ?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "team_0090_select_01",
      "hash64": "200585D7058117F9",
      "text": "Oui, depuis un moment.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "team_0090_select_02",
      "hash64": "200582D7058112E0",
      "text": "Je ne le connais pas tellement...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_11",
      "hash64": "40994D6F6577804D",
      "text": "Quoi qu’il en soit, c’est quelqu’un sur qui\\non peut compter.\\c\\nÇa me rappelle le bon vieux temps, avec\\nles autres... Ils étaient pareils...[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
