      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "team_0090_select_04",
      "hash64": "200588D705811D12",
      "text": "« Les autres » ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_12",
      "hash64": "40994A6F65777B34",
      "text": "... Comme tu le sais déjà, la Team Star est un\\nrassemblement d’élèves victimes de harcèlement.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_13",
      "hash64": "40994B6F65777CE7",
      "text": "Quelque temps après la formation de\\ncette organisation, les boss ont provoqué\\r\\nen duel les auteurs de ces harcèlements.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_14",
      "hash64": "4099486F657777CE",
      "text": "Et ils ont remporté la victoire haut la main.\\nEnfin, si on peut le dire.\\r\\nCar aucun combat n’a eu lieu.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_15",
      "hash64": "4099496F65777981",
      "text": "Les harceleurs ont tout simplement capitulé.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_16",
      "hash64": "4099466F65777468",
      "text": "Effrayés par la Team Star, ils ont cessé d’aller\\nà l’école, les uns après les autres...[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_17",
      "hash64": "4099476F6577761B",
      "text": "C’est à cause de ça que les membres de\\nl’organisation ont acquis une mauvaise réputation.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_19",
      "hash64": "4099456F657772B5",
      "text": "... Pardon, je me rends compte que tout ça ne te\\nconcerne pas.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_20",
      "hash64": "4095C66F65746511",
      "text": "Voici ta récompense : je vais transférer quelques\\nPL sur ton téléphone.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "team_0090_system_02",
      "hash64": "CEB959DBE0C2FF1B",
      "text": "Vous avez reçu 10 000 PL !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "team_0090_system_03",
      "hash64": "CEB958DBE0C2FD68",
      "text": "La Machine à CT propose désormais davantage\\nde CT à fabriquer !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_18",
      "hash64": "4099446F65777102",
      "text": "N’hésite pas à utiliser ces nouvelles CT pour\\nvenir à bout du dernier obstacle.\\c\\nJe t’envoie tout de suite quelqu’un de l’équipe\\nde ravitaillement.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
